  "stem": "A curved section of a railway line in Bangladesh is an arc of a circle with a radius of 900 meters. The arc's central angle measures \\(40^{\\circ}\\). The length of the curved section is \\(k\\pi\\) meters. What is the value of \\(k\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "200"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Arc length \\(= \\frac{40}{360} \\cdot 2\\pi(900)\\).",
    "\\(= \\frac{1}{9} \\cdot 1{,}800\\pi = 200\\pi\\), so \\(k = 200\\)."
  ],
  "explanation": null,
  "traps": null,
  "verify": "ans=Rational(40,360)*2*900\nassert ans==200\nassert all(Rational(s)==ans for s in spr_answers)\n",
